  "lineage": "Melodic pop from the fishing town of Volendam, named after the smoked eel (paling) the town is known for, that grew out of local beat groups in the 1960s. The Cats set its template of soft, sentimental songs with close-harmony vocals, and BZN, later the 3JS and Jan Smit carried it on into the twenty-first century.",
